@title Heat: the airflow lines keep a light edge in the Light theme
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The airflow streamlines are drawn with a halo under the line. It used to be a fixed near-black in both themes; it is now the theme's surface colour at half opacity, so in Light the lines have a light edge. Contour lines stay dark on purpose: they run over the fixed heat ramp. Needs a finished run for Airflow to be on offer. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key shift+h
wait 60
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 150
click_text Airflow
wait 30
shot airflow-dark
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 20
shot airflow-light
check_layout
check_blank airflow-light
